# CVEs accepted with documented reason. Each entry MUST include:
#   - the CVE
#   - the affected base image
#   - a link to the upstream tracker
#   - a monthly re-check date
#
# Example:
#   # CVE-XXXX-YYYYY — unfixed in nginx:alpine (upstream tracker: ...).
#   # Review by 2026-06-01.
#   CVE-XXXX-YYYYY
